ve Gaming Monitor\nFlat Gaming Monitor\nMonitor Arm\nSim Racing\nRacing Simulator Cockpit\nFlight Simulator Cockpit\nRacing Wheel and Pedals\nMonitor Stand\nSimucube\nAccessories\nGAMING PC\nCOMMUNITY\nJoin TT Mod\nLighting Mix Invitation\nCasemod Invitation\nMarketing Materials\n3D Maker\nThermaltake Esports League\nJoin Us on Social Media\nSUPPORT\nCustomer Support\nWarranty Policy\neRMA Service\nSoftware Downloads\nWHERE TO BUY\nSALE\nSearch\nLog in\nCart\nItem added to your cart\nView cart\nCheck out\nContinue shopping\nSkip to product information\nOpen media 1 in modal\nOpen media 2 in modal\nOpen media 3 in modal\nOpen media 4 in modal\nOpen media 5 in modal\nOpen media 6 in modal\nOpen media 7 in modal\nOpen media 8 in modal\nOpen media 9 in modal\nOpen media 10 in modal\nOpen media 11 in modal\nOpen media 12 in modal\nOpen media 13 in modal\nOpen media 14 in modal\n1\n/\nof\n14\nToughpower SFX 600W Gold\nToughpower SFX 600W Gold\nSKU:PS-STP-0600FPCGUS-G\nRegular price\n$119.99 USD\nRegular price\nSale price\n$119.99 USD\nUnit price\n/\nper\nSale\nSold out\nToughpower Series STP-0600F-G – 600W 80 PLUS® Gold Certified Fully Modular APFC PSU\n600W\n450W\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nDecrease quantity for Toughpower SFX 600W Gold\nIncrease quantity for Toughpower SFX 600W Gold\nDiscontinued\nCouldn't load pickup availability\nRefresh\nView full details\nDesign\nSpecification\nDownload\nHow-to Videos\nThermaltake Toughpower SFX 600W Gold\nIncorporating various high-quality components, Toughpower SFX 600W Gold saves energy through its 80 PLUS Gold certified high efficiency of up to 90% and accommodates any mainstream build. The included matte black SFX to ATX adapter bracket enables users to easily install SFX Power supply into ATX chassis. Additionally, an embedded temperature controlled Zero RPM Smart Fan System is optimized to deliver excellent airflow at an exceptionally low noise level. Fully modular flat cable design is convenient for cable management. Moreover, the powerful single +12V rail enables non-stop usage with stable and reliable performance.\n80 PLUS Gold Certified and Kaby Lake Ready\nDeliver up to 90% efficiency under real world load conditions to promise lowest power losses. Additionally, Toughpower SFX 600W Gold has been optimized to work with Intel’s new 6th-generation Kaby Lake processors to achieve maximum energy savings.\nUniversal Compact Design for All Mainstream PC Cases – SFX to ATX PSU Adapter Bracket\nToughpower SFX 600W Gold is designed with two-way application by the compatibility of both the latest Intel SFX 12V 3.3 and ATX 12V 2.4 standard. Toughpowr SFX Series has included a matte black SFX to ATX adapter bracket which helps users easily install an SFX power supply into an ATX, Micro-ATX or Mini-ITX chassis. In addition, with the compact design, Toughpower SFX Series allows better airflow inside the chassis as well as leaves more space for users to utilize.\nZero RPM Smart Fan\nTo maximally reduce undesired noise, Toughpower SFX 600W Gold is designed with an 80mm temperature controlled Zero RPM Smart Fan. The fan will not operate when the PSU is at low working loads.\nFully Modular Low-Profile Flat Cables\nFully modular Toughpower SFX 600W Gold offers cables selection for users while powering the system at an advantageous voltage. Low-profile flat black cable can make cable management easier, reduce clutter and increase airflow inside the chassis.\n100% High Quality Japanese Capacitors\nToughpower SFX 600W Gold features 100% high quality Japanese brand capacitors, which greatly improves the durability and offers the highest stability and reliability.\nMassive and Dedicated +12V Output\nToughpower SFX 600W Gold is equipped with a powerful single +12V rail, please see the output specification below:\nAC INPUT\nInput Voltage: 100V-240V\nInput Current: 4.5A-9A\nFrequency: 50Hz-60Hz\nDC OUTPUT\n+3.3V\n+5V\n+12V\n-12V\n+5Vsb\nMax Output Current\n20A\n15A\n50A\n0.3A\n2.5A\nMax Output Power\n90W\n600W\n3.6W\n12.5W\nContinuous Power\n600W\nProduct Specifications\nP/N\nPS-STP-0600FPCGUS-G\nModel\nSTP-600AH1FEG\nType\nIntel SFX 12V 3.3 and ATX 12V 2.4\nForm Factor\nSFX\nRGB Fan\nNo\nWatts\n600W\nMax Output Capacity\n600W\nPeak Output Capacity\n720W\nColor\nBlack\nPFC (Power Factor Correction)\nActive PFC\nPower Good Signal\n100-500 msec\nHold Up Time\n> 12msec at 75% of full load\nInput Current\n4.5A – 9A\nInput Frequency Range\n50Hz - 60Hz\nInput Voltage\n100V - 240V\nOperating Temperture\n0 ℃ to +40℃\nOperating Humidity\n20% to 85%,non-condensing\nStorage Temperture\n-20 ℃ to +90 ℃\nStorage Humidity\n5% to 95%, non-condensing\nCooling System\n8cm fan\nEfficiency\nMEET 80 PLUS®Gold at 115Vac input.\nMTBF\n120,000 hrs minimum\nSafety Approval\nCE/FCC/UL/Bauart Mark+CB/EAC\nPCI-E 6+2PIN\n2\nUser Manual\nFile Name\nDescription\nSize\nVersion\nRelease Date\nManual\nMulti-language\n2016-05-25\nDrivers & Software\nFile Name\nDescription\nSize\nVersion\nRelease Date\nCONTACT\nCustomer Support\nSales Partner Request\nMedia Contact\nSUPPORT\nSubmit A Request\nWarranty Policy\nHow to Find S/N\neRMA Service\nSoftware Downloads\nCOMMUNITY\nJoin TT Mod\nCaseMOD Invitation\nPress Release\nMarketing Materials\n3D Maker\nCOMPANY\nAbout Us\nStore Policy\nWhere to Buy\nLANGUAGE\nUnited States/Canada\nBrazil\nLatam\nSubscribe to our emails\nEmail\nFacebook\nInstagram\nYouTube\nTikTok\nTwitter\nTwitch\nDiscord\nReddit\nCountry/region\nUSD\n$ | United States\nCAD\n$ |\nCanada\nUSD\n$ |\nUnited States\nLanguage\nEnglish\nEnglish\nFrançais\n© 2026, Thermaltake USA\nPowered by Shopify\nChoosing a selection results in a full page refresh.\nOpens in a new window.",
